## Frontend Changes

#### [login/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/BHU%20INTERNSHIP%20PROJECT/frontend/src/app/login/page.tsx)
Complete rewrite with 4-phase UI:

| Phase | Name | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| 1 | `LOGIN` | Email + password + **mandatory** Turnstile CAPTCHA. Sign In button disabled until CAPTCHA passes. "Forgot your password?" link below form. |
| 2 | `FORGOT_EMAIL` | Email input + Turnstile CAPTCHA → "Send Reset Code" |
| 3 | `FORGOT_OTP` | 6-digit OTP input boxes with auto-focus, paste support, countdown timer, resend. **Auto-advances** to Phase 4 when all 6 digits entered. |
| 4 | `RESET_PASSWORD` | New password + confirm password with `PasswordStrength` component. Submit → success screen → auto-redirect to login. |

**Design features:**
- Left panel step indicator (3-step dots) shows progress through forgot password flow
- Smooth `animate-fade-in` transitions between phases
- Password mismatch live warning
- All patterns match the existing register page (OTP boxes, Turnstile, PasswordStrength)

